<title>UK: Sept Statfjord sets 24 cargoes plus 5 Aug deferrals.</title>
<headline>Sept Statfjord sets 24 cargoes plus 5 Aug deferrals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's September Statfjord crude loading programme, released on Thursday, schedules 24 cargoes, four less than in the original August programme, traders said.</p>
<p>Five cargoes deferred from August after production problems at the Snorre field, are also now scheduled to load in early September, the traders said.  </p>
<p>The five August deferrals are scheduled to load in the period up to September 6.</p>
<p>The first of the new September programme is due to lift on September 6-8.</p>
<p>Offshore-loading Statfjord cargoes are 855,000 barrels apiece.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
